      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تراكب</span></b> : see 1: and 5. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تراكب</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّحَابُ</span> <i>The clouds were,</i> or <i>became,</i> [<i>heaped,</i> or
<i>piled, up,</i>] <i>one above,</i> or <i>upon,</i> [or <i>overlying,</i>]
<i>another;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تراكم</span>. (TA.)

